result
result-*

# There is deliberately NO `.env` route in this repository and no dotenv in the
# development shell. This layer holds no credential of its own: it is handed a
# token by a consumer and compares it, and every secret in the tree is a
# SYNTHETIC- prefixed fixture that exists to be searched for. An environment
# file here would be a credential surface on the one component that must not
# have one.
.env
